source	Thomas Aquinas, Summa Theologica I q.22 a.4 obj. 1, tr. Fathers of the English Dominican Province
text	Project Gutenberg ebook 17611, https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/17611
class	scope
word	of necessity
fault	that the effect "flows of necessity" from providence, which cannot be frustrated, is the necessity of the consequence (necessarily, what is provided happens); that providence imposes necessity on the things needs the necessity of the consequent
reference	Aquinas, ST I q.22 a.4 ad 1; Boethius, Consolation V.6 (simple and conditional necessity)
known	canon
